diff --git a/changelog.d/1457.change.md b/changelog.d/1457.change.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d3a4c01
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1457.change.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Setting `kw_only=True` on a class no longer makes attributes inherited from a base class keyword-only -- only the attributes defined on that class are affected, matching the behavior of standard library `dataclasses`.
diff --git a/src/attr/_make.py b/src/attr/_make.py
